{"strongs": "H3906", "word": "לַ֫חַץ", "translit": "la.chats", "root": "לחח", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "oppression, distress", "definition": "לַ֫חַץ noun masculine oppression, distress ; — ׳ ל absolute 1Kgs 22:27 (twice in verse) + 5 t.; construct 2Kgs 13:4 + 2 t.; suffix לַחֲצֵ֫נוּ Deut 26:4 ; Ps 44:25 — oppression of Israel Exod 3:9 ( E ; + verb cognate), 2Kgs 13:4 compare Deut 26:7 (|| עֳנִי , עָמָל ) Ps 44:25 (|| עֳנִי ); oppression of (i.e. by) an enemy, Ps 42:10 ; Ps 43:2 in general Job 36:15 ׅ || עֳנִי ; ׳ וּמַיִם ל ׳ לֶחֶם ל 1Kgs 22:27 = 2Chr 18:26 bread of oppression and water of oppression , i.e. prison-fare (> Klo scanty fare); compare ׳ לֶחֶם צַר וּמַיִם ל Isa 30:20 , apparently of privations of a siege (compare Che Di Du ; on the apposition in these passages see Ges «GKC:131»§ 131 . 2 (b) Kö iii, § 333 p.q. Da Synt. § 29. e ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4400')\">BDB4400</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3906')\">H3906</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4399')\">BDB4399</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4401')\">BDB4401</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>לַ֫חַץ</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b> <highlightword>oppression, distress</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ל</bdbheb> absolute <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:27\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,27)\">1Kgs 22:27</ref> (twice in verse) + 5 t.; construct <ref ref=\"2Kgs 13:4\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(12,13,4)\">2Kgs 13:4</ref> + 2 t.; suffix <bdbheb>לַחֲצֵ֫נוּ</bdbheb><ref ref=\"Deut 26:4\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(5,26,4)\">Deut 26:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 44:25\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(19,44,25)\">Ps 44:25</ref> — <highlight>oppression</highlight> of Israel <ref ref=\"Exod 3:9\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(2,3,9)\">Exod 3:9</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; + verb cognate), <ref ref=\"2Kgs 13:4\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(12,13,4)\">2Kgs 13:4</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Deut 26:7\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(5,26,7)\">Deut 26:7</ref> (|| <bdbheb>עֳנִי</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>עָמָל</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Ps 44:25\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(19,44,25)\">Ps 44:25</ref> (|| <bdbheb>עֳנִי</bdbheb>); <highlight>oppression of</highlight> (i.e. by) an enemy, <ref ref=\"Ps 42:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,42,10)\">Ps 42:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 43:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,43,2)\">Ps 43:2</ref> in general <ref ref=\"Job 36:15\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(18,36,15)\">Job 36:15</ref> <bdbheb>ׅ</bdbheb> || <bdbheb>עֳנִי</bdbheb>; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וּמַיִם ל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לֶחֶם ל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:27\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,27)\">1Kgs 22:27</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 18:26\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(14,18,26)\">2Chr 18:26</ref> <highlight>bread of oppression and water of oppression</highlight>, i.e. prison-fare (&gt; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Klo')\">Klo</lookup> <highlight>scanty</highlight> fare); compare <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לֶחֶם צַר וּמַיִם ל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 30:20\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(23,30,20)\">Isa 30:20</ref>, apparently of privations of a siege (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Che')\">Che</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Du')\">Du</lookup>; on the apposition in these passage